  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d5562cc34807e2439c5cc188b7351d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Step_02_StaticIP_Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSequence
  lines:
  - speakerName: Instructor
    text: A server must never get its address from DHCP. If that address changed,
      every client depending on it would lose the connection. That is why we set
      it by hand.
  - speakerName: Instructor
    text: Enter the values from the job order. All three boxes must be right before
      the step will accept it.
